Hello everyone!
Here's the changelog of version 1.1:

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44442628/f03677eb6442d5f2f188d5aad07c4735f75ed4ab.gif

Revamped "Options Menu", with new buttons such as VSync and language;
Keybindings were added in a new section of the "Options Menu";
Complete translation to Brazilian Portuguese (PTBR);
Added a very small margin of error for jumping after falling from a ground (coyote jump);
Now the settings and progress are saved in separate files;

Some bugs were also fixed:

Extended the collision with vertical moving platforms, so now it's less likely to fall from them when standing too close to the edge;
Many visual bugs;
Some sound related issues;

I'll keep working on fixing stuff as much as I can, so any feedback is appreciated.
Thank you so much for playing Forest of Strays!

~ Akseru
